<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa calls 1200 GMT news conference on Telkom.</title>
<headline>S.Africa calls 1200 GMT news conference on Telkom.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Posts, Telecommunications and Brodcasting Ministry said it was calling a news conference to announce details of the partial privatisation of Telkom at 1200 GMT on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Officials said this week that the government was finalising terms for the sale of 30 percent of the concern to SBC Communications Inc and Telekom Malaysia Bhd.</p>
<p>Analysts expect the sale to raise some six billion rand.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
